OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban could last until
OL,4,Awinter, firm admits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hosepipe ban is likely to remain in
OL,7,Fplace for a number of months, Anglian
OL,8,FWater has warned.
OL,10,FThe company, which serves seven million
OL,11,Fcustomers, predominantly in the East of
OL,12,FEngland, introduced the ban in July
OL,13,Fciting "unrelenting" hot and dry
OL,14,Fconditions.
OL,16,FGrant Tufts from Anglian Water told a
OL,17,Fmeeting at Norfolk County Council the
OL,18,Fban may be in place until "even the
OL,19,Fwinter".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
